			"notes": "EFN Client 1.2.0 for Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric), **with the stealer dropper removed**,\nbuilt from this repository's source by GitHub Actions.\n\nRemoved from the original `efn-client-1.2.0.jar`: `net.efn.agent.AgentInit` (dropper),\n`assets/efn/data/runtime.dat` (encrypted stage-2 stealer), the `main` entrypoint that\nlaunched it, and the hijacked `Main-Class`. See README for verification details.\n\nThis build passed an in-game smoke test in CI: the production jar boots a real client to\nthe title screen, a Mixin audit applies all of EFN's 267 injections without error, and\nevery EFN class's static initializer runs without error.\nScreenshots are in the workflow run's `smoketest` artifact.\n\nRequires Fabric Loader >= 0.16 and Fabric API. Checksums in `SHA256SUMS.txt`."
		}
